{"4344280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "1000 Rooms", "steam_appid": 4344280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 1 to 9 of your friends, or play solo, and take on the gauntlet!<br><br>You are a prisoner in the (not too distant) future and have exchanged your life sentence for 1000 rooms.<br>The taste of freedom is within your grasp, but monsters (and sometimes your friends) stand in your way.<br>Fight your way through hordes of the undead with over 1 MILLION different GUNS, GRENADES, and much more at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room in the gauntlet will take you to worlds from all realities, meaning no two runs will be the same.<br>Try to survive, gamble, shoot, and fish with your friends as you risk losing everything each run.<br><br>Your prisoner only has 1 life, so use it well. Everything you find, equip, and upgrade persists between each run, so think carefully about how you want to tackle each room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose the length of your gauntlet, with 2 being the shortest and 20 the longest. The rooms get exponentially harder deeper into the gauntlet, so choose your adventure's length carefully. There will be zombies, campfires, guns, quests, cookies, fishing, more guns, grenades, slot machines, even more guns, and much more awaiting you within the 1000 Rooms!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 1 to 9 of your friends, or play solo, and take on the gauntlet!<br><br>You are a prisoner in the (not too distant) future and have exchanged your life sentence for 1000 rooms.<br>The taste of freedom is within your grasp, but monsters (and sometimes your friends) stand in your way.<br>Fight your way through hordes of the undead with over 1 MILLION different GUNS, GRENADES, and much more at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room in the gauntlet will take you to 